WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.067
The readmission project combines several ideas from this module.

00:00:04.067 --> 00:00:07.802
First, admissions are ordered within each patient.

00:00:07.802 --> 00:00:12.572
Lag brings the previous discharge time onto the current admission row.

00:00:12.572 --> 00:00:18.531
Next, another stage calculates the gap between the previous discharge and the new admission.

00:00:19.008 --> 00:00:24.730
Finally, the query classifies whether the return occurred within thirty days.

00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:33.680
This is a realistic example of advanced S Q L because the solution depends on grain, sequence, a window function,

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:36.055
and staged logic working together.
